{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"product_name\":\"便携式反无人机无线电主动防御设备\",\"product_name_en\":\"Hand-held Active RF Defense System (Spoofing)\",\"summary\":\"该设备采用卫星导航模拟技术，发射导航诱骗信号，使无人机被驱离。通过部署该设备，可使管控区域外的无人机无法进入防护区域，维护重点部位的低空空域安全。 图1便携式反无人机无线电主动防御设备\",\"summary_en\":\"This equipment utilizes satellite navigation simulation technology to emit navigation spoofing signals, causing drones to be repelled. By deploying this spoofing device, unauthorized drones are prevented from entering protected areas, thereby maintaining low-altitude airspace security for critical locations.\",\"key_application\":\"应用领域：发射功率低，符合国家标准。；具有国家工信部颁发的无线电发射设备型号核准证，符合相关行业的国家标准及要求。；涵盖GPS、GLONASS、伽利略等导航信号，可应对多模导航无人机。\",\"key_application_en\":\"Low-power emission compliant with radiation safety standards; official radio type approval from MIIT; comprehensive GNSS coverage (GPS, GLONASS, Galileo) for multi-mode drone neutralization.\",\"key_parameter_1\":\"有效作用距离: 大于500米、小于1000米，距离可调\",\"key_parameter_1_en\":\"Effective Range: 500m - 1000m (Adjustable)\",\"key_parameter_2\":\"设备重量: ≤8kg\",\"key_parameter_2_en\":\"Weight: ≤8kg\",\"parameters\":{\"发射频率\":\"GPS L1 /GLONASSL1/ Galileo E1\",\"输出功率\":\"≤10dBm (mW)\",\"诱骗响应时间\":\"≤10s\",\"同步时间精度\":\"＜1us\",\"有效作用距离\":\"大于500米、小于1000米，距离可调\",\"有效驱离角度\":\"水平360°，垂直±90°\",\"功耗\":\"≤30W\",\"定位功能\":\"设备支持GPS定位上报经纬度信息\",\"设备重量\":\"≤8kg\",\"工作温度\":\"-40℃~+65℃\",\"外壳防护等级\":\"IP65\"},\"parameters_en\":\"{\\\"Frequency Bands\\\":\\\"GPS L1, GLONASS L1, Galileo E1\\\",\\\"Output Power\\\":\\\"≤10dBm (mW)\\\",\\\"Spoofing Response\\\":\\\"≤10s\\\",\\\"Sync Accuracy\\\":\\\"＜1us\\\",\\\"Effective Range\\\":\\\"500m - 1000m (Adjustable)\\\",\\\"Coverage Angle\\\":\\\"360° Horizontal; ±90° Vertical\\\",\\\"Power Consumption\\\":\\\"≤30W\\\",\\\"Positioning\\\":\\\"Integrated GPS with coordinate reporting\\\",\\\"Weight\\\":\\\"≤8kg\\\",\\\"Operating Temp\\\":\\\"-40℃ to +65℃\\\",\\\"IP Rating\\\":\\\"IP65\\\"}\",\"detail_html\":\"<h4>功能特点</h4><ul><li>安全可靠</li